<title>USA: Applied Magnetics committed to Read-rite offer.</title>
<headline>Applied Magnetics committed to Read-rite offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Applied Magnetics Corp said it remains committed to its takeover bid for Read-Rite Corp, despite Read-Rites adoption today of a poison pill plan.</p>
<p>Applied Magnetics said it is confident Read-Rite shareholders will support its offer of 0.679 shares of Applies stock for every Read-Rite share.  </p>
<p>Earlier, Read-Rite said it adopted a shareholder rights plan designed to combat Applied's unsolicited takeover offer, which Read-Rite rejected on Monday.</p>
